# Corpus trees are LOCAL-ONLY (owner privacy decision, 2026-10-15): corpora
# contain real-life, probably private, spoken words. NOTHING under corpora/
# is ever committed — including manifest.json (a manifest leaks session
# timestamps/ids and source-library structure). Provenance stays on the
# working host; share findings via issues, never via committed manifests.
/corpora/
/samples/retained/*
!/samples/retained/.gitkeep
